DESCRIPTION:Let’s talk about cycling!\n\nThis October\, you have the cha
 nce to send a message that streets are for people\, and that Toronto can't
  wait! Come chat with your neighbours about cycling and contribute to Cycl
 e Toronto’s election strategy.\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/2026election
 townhall
LOCATION:Swansea Townhall\n95 Lavinia Avenue\nToronto\, Ontario ON M6S 3H9
 \nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/2026electiontownhall
END:VEVENT
